{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-9-1","title":"Psalms 9:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David praises God for executing judgment. 11 He incites others to praise him. 13 He prays that he may have cause to praise him.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2941. B.C. 1063. (Title.) Muthlabben.Probably, \"the death of the champion:\" so the Chaldee has, \"A Psalm of David, to be sung concerning the death of the man who went out between ({mibbeyney}) the camps;\" evidently considering {labben,} of the same import as {bainayim,} \"a middle-man or champion,\" as Goliath is termed, 1 Sa 17:4, concerning whose defeat this psalm is generally supposed to have been composed.</p>\n<p>praise. 7:17; 34:1-4; 103:1,2; 145:1-3; 146:1,2; 1Ch 29:10-13; Isa 12:1 Heb 13:15; Re 5:9-14 with my. 86:12; 111:1; 138:1; Lu 10:27 shew. 14; 51:15; 106:2; 1Ch 16:12,24; Isa 43:21; 60:6; Re 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-2","title":"Psalms 9:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I will be. 5:11; 27:6; 28:7; 43:4; 92:4; 97:12; Hab 3:17,18; Php 4:4 O thou. 7:17; 56:2,3; 83:18; 97:9; Da 5:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-3","title":"Psalms 9:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>they shall. 68:1,2; 76:7; 80:16; Isa 64:3; 2Th 1:9; Re 6:12-17; 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-4","title":"Psalms 9:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>For. 16:5; 140:12 maintained, etc. Heb. made my judgment. right. Heb. inrighteousness. 45:6,7; 47:8; 89:14; 96:13; 98:9; Isa 11:4; 1Pe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-5","title":"Psalms 9:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>rebuked. 2:1,8,9; 78:55; 79:10; 149:7; 1Sa 17:45-51; 2Sa 5:6-16; 8:1-15 2Sa 10:6-9; 21:15-22; 22:44-46; Re 19:15 destroyed. 5:6; 1Sa 25:32; 31:4; 2Sa 17:23; Mal 4:3 put out. De 9:14; Pr 10:7; 13:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-6","title":"Psalms 9:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>O thou, etc. or, The destructions of the enemy are come to aperpetual end, and their cities hast thou destroyed, etc. 7:5; 8:2; Ex 15:16; Mic 7:8,10 destructions. 46:9; Ex 14:13; Isa 10:24,25; 14:6-8; Na 1:9-13; 1Co 15:26,54-57 Re 20:2 thou hast. 1Sa 30:1; 31:7; Isa 10:6,7,13,14; 14:17; 37:26; Jer 51:25 memorial. 2Ki 19:25; Isa 14:22,23; Jer 51:62-64</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-7","title":"Psalms 9:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>But. 90:2; 102:12,24-27; Heb 1:11,12; 13:8; 2Pe 3:8 he hath. 50:3-5; 103:19; Re 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-8","title":"Psalms 9:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>50:6; 94:15; 96:13; 98:9; 99:4; Ge 18:25; Isa 11:4,5; Ac 17:31 Ro 2:5,6,16; Re 20:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-9","title":"Psalms 9:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>The Lord. 18:2; 32:7; 37:39; 46:1; 48:3; 62:8; 91:1,2; 142:4; De 33:27; Pr 18:10 Isa 4:5,6; 8:14; 32:2; Na 1:7; Lu 13:34; Heb 6:18 be a refuge. Heb. be a high place. 20:1; 46:7; *marg: in times. 50:15; 77:1,2; 108:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-10","title":"Psalms 9:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>know. 91:14; Ex 34:5-7; 1Ch 28:9; Pr 18:10; Joh 17:3; 2Co 4:6; 2Ti 1:12 1Jo 2:3; 5:20 put. 5:11; 57:1; 146:5,6; Isa 26:3,4 hast. 105:3,4; Isa 45:19; 46:3,4; 55:6,7; Jer 29:13; 2Co 1:9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-11","title":"Psalms 9:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Sing. 33:1-3; 47:6,7; 96:1,2; 148:1-5,13,14 which. 78:68; 132:13,14; Isa 12:6; 14:32; Heb 12:22; Re 14:1 declare. 66:2,5; 96:10; 105:1,2; 107:22; 118:17; Isa 12:4-6; Joh 17:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-12","title":"Psalms 9:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>When. Ge 9:5; 2Ki 24:4; Isa 26:21; Mt 23:35; Lu 11:50,51; Re 6:9,10; 16:6 he forgetteth. 10:14,17; 22:24; 34:6; 102:17; Ex 3:7,9; Lu 18:7,8 humble. or, afflicted. Jud 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-13","title":"Psalms 9:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Have. 51:1; 119:132 consider. 13:3; 25:19; 119:153; 142:6; Ne 9:32; La 1:9,11 thou. 30:3; 56:13; 86:13; 107:18; 116:3,4; Isa 38:10; Joh 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-14","title":"Psalms 9:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>That. 51:15; 79:13; 106:2 in the gates. 22:22,25; 35:18; 42:4; 109:30,31; 116:18,19; 118:19,20; 149:1,2 daughter. Isa 37:22; 62:11; Mic 4:13 I will. 13:5; 20:5; 21:1; 35:9; 51:12; 1Sa 2:1; Isa 12:3; Hab 3:18; Lu 1:47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-15","title":"Psalms 9:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>7:15,16; 35:8; 37:15; 57:6; 94:23; Pr 5:22; 22:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-16","title":"Psalms 9:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>known. 48:11; 58:10,11; 83:17,18; Ex 7:5; 14:4,10,31; De 29:22-28 Jos 2:10,11; Jud 1:7; 1Sa 6:19,20; 17:46; 2Ki 19:19,34,35 wicked. 11:6; 140:9; Pr 6:2; 12:13; Isa 8:15; 28:13 Higgaion, that is, Meditation. 5:1; 19:14; 92:3; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-17","title":"Psalms 9:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>The wicked. Pr 14:32; Isa 3:11; 5:14; Mt 25:41-46; Ro 2:8,9; 2Th 1:7-9 Re 20:15; 21:8 forget. 44:17,20; 50:22; 106:13; Job 8:13; Jer 2:32; 3:21; 13:25; 18:15 Ho 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-18","title":"Psalms 9:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>For the. 12; 12:5; 72:4,12-14; 102:17,20; 109:31; Lu 1:53; 6:20; Jas 2:5 expectation. Pr 23:18; 24:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-19","title":"Psalms 9:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Arise. 3:7; 7:6; 10:12; 44:23,26; 68:1,2; 74:22,23; 76:8,9; 80:2 Isa 42:13,14; 51:9; Zep 3:8 let not. Ge 32:28; 1Sa 2:9; 2Ch 14:11; Isa 42:13 let the. 2:1-3; 79:6; 149:7; Jer 10:25; Joe 3:12; Mic 5:15; Zec 14:18 Re 19:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-9-20","title":"Psalms 9:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":9,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":9,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>Put. 76:12; Ex 15:16; 23:27; De 2:25; Jer 32:40; Eze 30:13 may. 82:6,7; Isa 31:3; Eze 28:2,9; Ac 12:22,23</p>"}]}